<p>Other secrets outside Key Vault:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>GitHub Actions secrets</strong> for the deployment workflow (Azure login credentials; <code>GITHUB_TOKEN</code> for GHCR).</li>
    <li><strong>ChurchSuite OAuth</strong> site-wide client secret, if configured (env var or configuration).</li>
    <li>The email app's <strong>JWT validation key</strong>, hard-coded in its <code>Program.cs</code> (see <a asp-page="/Docs/Admin/Email" asp-fragment="authentication-between-the-apps">Authentication between the apps</a>).</li>
    <li>The <strong>Grafana Loki login ID</strong>, hard-coded in <code>LoggingConfiguration</code> (an identifier, not a password).</li>
    <li>Development: <code>appsettings.Development.json</code> connection string and the local <code>DataProtectionKeys</code> folder.</li>
</ul>

